@startuml Drone Executor State Machine
!theme cerulean

title DroneExecutor Finite State Machine (Nav2 Integration)

[*] --> BOOT : System startup

BOOT --> PREFLIGHT : Nav2 server ready
BOOT --> EMERGENCY : 60s timeout\n(Nav2 not available)
BOOT --> BOOT : Waiting for\nNavigateToPose server...

PREFLIGHT --> ARMED : TF checks passed
PREFLIGHT --> PREFLIGHT : Running checks...

ARMED --> TAKING_OFF : Takeoff command
ARMED --> ARMED : Waiting...

TAKING_OFF --> STAGING : Direct transition\n(skipped in simulation)

STAGING --> AVAILABLE : Mission running
STAGING --> STAGING : Waiting for mission

AVAILABLE --> EXECUTING_GOAL : Assignment received\n(robot_id:frontier_id:cx:cy)
AVAILABLE --> AVAILABLE : Waiting for goals

EXECUTING_GOAL --> AVAILABLE : Nav2 goal succeeded
EXECUTING_GOAL --> RECOVERY : Nav2 goal failed/aborted
EXECUTING_GOAL --> EXECUTING_GOAL : Navigating via Nav2...

RECOVERY --> EXECUTING_GOAL : Retry navigation
RECOVERY --> EMERGENCY : Too many failures
RECOVERY --> AVAILABLE : Recovery timeout\n(become available)
RECOVERY --> RECOVERY : Attempting recovery...

AVAILABLE --> RETURNING : Mission end
EXECUTING_GOAL --> RETURNING : Mission end

RETURNING --> LANDING : Return goal reached
RETURNING --> RETURNING : Returning home...

LANDING --> LANDED : Landing complete
LANDING --> LANDING : Descending...

LANDED --> [*] : Mission complete

EMERGENCY --> [*] : Emergency shutdown

' Critical emergency transitions
BOOT --> EMERGENCY : Nav2 timeout (60s)

note right of BOOT
    Wait for Nav2
    NavigateToPose
    action server
    (60s timeout)
end note

note right of TAKING_OFF
    Skipped in simulation
    Direct to STAGING
end note

note right of AVAILABLE : **Key State**
    Ready for exploration
    Parses assignment format:
    robot_id:frontier_id:cx:cy
end note

note right of EXECUTING_GOAL
    Sends NavigateToPose
    goal to Nav2 with
    computed yaw toward target
end note

note right of RECOVERY
    Handle Nav2 failures
    Retry or give up
end note

note right of EMERGENCY
    Safety mode
    Cancels active Nav2 goal
    on node shutdown
end note

@enduml
